          "status": true,
          "name": "Marine and Coastal",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Coastal ecosystems are uniquely vulnerable, bearing the combined stresses of anthropogenic pressures and rising seas. As global climate shifts intensify these threats, we generate the science to protect marine biodiversity and costal livelihoods. Through in-situ monitoring, laboratory experiments, and policy-driven research spanning biogeochemical fluxes, blue carbon, marine pollution, sustainable aquaculture, and sea-based products, we deliver actionable solutions to accelerate a thriving, resilient blue economy and empower community-based resource management.</p>",
            "format": "full_html",
            "processed": "<p>Coastal ecosystems are uniquely vulnerable, bearing the combined stresses of anthropogenic pressures and rising seas. As global climate shifts intensify these threats, we generate the science to protect marine biodiversity and costal livelihoods. Through in-situ monitoring, laboratory experiments, and policy-driven research spanning biogeochemical fluxes, blue carbon, marine pollution, sustainable aquaculture, and sea-based products, we deliver actionable solutions to accelerate a thriving, resilient blue economy and empower community-based resource management.</p>"
