            "processed": "<p>TERI's Western Regional Centre in Goa was established in 1996 and over the years has gained expertise in promoting efficient solutions in the areas of coastal ecology, marine resources, water resource management, agriculture, biodiversity assessment and waste management. Our work on climate science and policy research, capacity building and awareness generation is geared towards educating rural and urban communities across the region to collectively develop sustainable development pathways.</p>"
